Google Material Icons

This source distribution contains embedded vector path data from Google Material Icons, pinned to repository revision 10ecc14790612ca8fd164e3f4ffe9c16fc50d5b7. The 35 Wizard icon variants map to 33 upstream SVG files listed in docs/open-source/MATERIAL-ICONS.md. All retained variants use the pinned path data; the former game-only Pet and Leaderboard paths are no longer included.

The upstream project makes these icons available under Apache License 2.0. A copy of that license accompanies this source at licenses/Material-Icons-Apache-2.0.txt. Wizard renders the paths with local Core Graphics code; upstream SVG files, fonts, and image binaries are not included. The application license is separate.

The retained mapping was checked on 2026-11-12 against the previously verified 2026-11-10 inventory; retained path data is unchanged.

